title: Payers › Header › What the facts mean
route: /payers/:id
intro: The card above the tabs. It names the payer, says whether a change is waiting, and shows four facts. Two come from the last 90 days of decisions; two are the payer's configuration and change when someone edits the payer.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Pick a payer\n(or arrive on Payers)"
screen head "Payer header\nPayer name in large type\nPlan line under it\n'Edit log' and 'Edit' on the right"
process plan "Plan line = plan text\n+ 'rules version 2026.3'\n+ the state of the rules"
decision pend "Is a change waiting\nfor this payer?"
toast waiting "'... rules version 2026.3, change waiting'"
toast checked "'... rules version 2026.3, checked 10/12'\nDate Sentinel last checked the policy"

group gF "Four facts under the name"
  screen f1 "'Approved as asked'\n74% for Summit\nNote: 'last 90 days'\nCardinal says 'down 11 points'"
  screen f2 "'Typical decision'\n1.5 days for Summit\nNote: 'for residential'\nCardinal says 'now taking 2.8'"
  screen f3 "'Notice due'\n24 hours\nNote: 'after admission'\nHarborview is 72 hours"
  screen f4 "'Reached by'\nOne of seven: Portal, Phone, Fax,\nor a mix such as 'Portal and fax'\nNote: the backup route\n'phone as backup'"
endgroup

decision hist "Does the payer have\n90 days of decisions?"
toast few "'Not enough' in both figures\nNotes: 'Not enough decisions yet'\nand 'benchmark estimate'\nTrue of a payer added with 'Add a payer'"
process real "Figures come from decisions\nalready seen for this payer"
process cfg "'Notice due' and 'Reached by' come\nfrom the payer's saved details\nthe 'Edit' button changes them"

decision logn "Any edits logged for this payer?"
screen logb1 "Button reads 'Edit log (3)'\nthe count is edits for this payer"
screen logb0 "Button reads 'Edit log'"
click ce "Click 'Edit'"
click cl "Click 'Edit log'"
goto g_edit "Continues in: Payers › Edit payer details"
goto g_log "Continues in: Payers › Edit log"
end e1 "Header shows the payer's current state"

s1 --> head --> plan --> pend
pend -->|Yes| waiting --> hist
pend -->|No| checked --> hist
head --> f1 & f2 & f3 & f4
hist -->|No| few --> logn
hist -->|Yes| real --> logn
f3 -.-> cfg
f4 -.-> cfg
logn -->|Yes| logb1 --> e1
logn -->|No| logb0 --> e1
head --> ce --> g_edit
head --> cl --> g_log
